.TH ITCMDR\-AGENT\-WATCHDOG 1 "" "itcmdr" "itcmdr manual"
.SH NAME
itcmdr\-agent\-watchdog \- keeps itcmdr\-agent running and rolls back bad upgrades
.SH ITCMDR\-AGENT\-WATCHDOG
.nf
itcmdr watchdog: upgrades, rollback, restarts
\&
Usage: itcmdr\-agent\-watchdog [OPTIONS]
\&
Options:
      \-\-root <ROOT>                  Program folder. Agent: the folder holding current\\ (default: the folder above this exe's folder). Server: the server folder itself (default: <folder above this exe's>\\server)
      \-\-data <DATA>                  Data folder (health.json, upgrade\\). Default: %ProgramData%\\itcmdr\\agent (agent) or %ProgramData%\\itcmdr (server)
      \-\-service\-name <SERVICE_NAME>  Service to watch (default: itcmdr\-agent or itcmdr\-server)
      \-\-stale\-secs <STALE_SECS>      Restart the service when its health file is older than this (seconds) [default: 300]
      \-\-once                         Run one pass and exit (tests, manual use)
  \-h, \-\-help                         Print help
  \-V, \-\-version                      Print version
.fi
.SH ENVIRONMENT
.TP
.B ITCMDR_AGENT_DIR
agent data folder (default %ProgramData%\\itcmdr\\agent, /var/lib/itcmdr\-agent)
.SH SEE ALSO
\fBitcmdr\fR(7), docs/README.md (also the in-app help: \fBitcmdr-cli help\fR, \fBitcmdr-admin help\fR)
